{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Data Explorer is a sandbox-style environment where datasets come to life - translated into physical features like color, size, motion and more.  The goal is to let you experience your data in fun and creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose from different graphing types (called &quot;Explorers&quot;), each of which visualizes the data dynamically in real time.  Data is loaded from Jsonl and CSV files, which players can create, modify, or select during gameplay.  Each Explorer has a few simple guidelines for the data it reads, and players are encouraged to write scripts or choose datasets that fit those formats - with examples provided to help you get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is packaged with python and includes Pandas and NumPy, but you can also load scripts and datasets from any directory of your choice.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683750?t=1759512522","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683750/42674648ba3959e58e30bc78b083243d918631ef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759512522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683750/6c4cae9ae41c529ff92f20660848f38e0a07d3ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759512522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683750/6c4cae9ae41c529ff92f20660848f38e0a07d3ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759512522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Data Explorer is a sandbox-style environment where datasets come to life - translated into physical features like color, size, motion and more.  The goal is to let you experience your data in fun and creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose from different graphing types (called &quot;Explorers&quot;), each of which visualizes the data dynamically in real time.  Data is loaded from Jsonl and CSV files, which players can create, modify, or select during gameplay.  Each Explorer has a few simple guidelines for the data it reads, and players are encouraged to write scripts or choose datasets that fit those formats - with examples provided to help you get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is packaged with python and includes Pandas and NumPy, but you can also load scripts and datasets from any directory of your choice.</p>","developers":["Star Weaver's Production"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683750/8d931040a7b0e57cdbae7f68d0c4f5a111d8addd/header.jpg?t=1759512522","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"This software uses Python, NumPy, and Pandas, which are licensed under permissive open-source licenses (PSF and BSD 3-Clause). Copyrights for these libraries are retained by their respective creators.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3683750/2039821543/96317c895bf969b02e4d7589316755adb20a4029/1759511775/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759512519","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3683750/2039821543/96317c895bf969b02e4d7589316755adb20a4029/1759511775/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759512519","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3683750/2039821543/96317c895bf969b02e4d7589316755adb20a4029/1759511775/hls_264_master.m3u8